//github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-196","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","order":196,"canonicalText":"〔一０〕師古曰：「廣立蕃屏，則天下安，故曰以安天下。」","sentenceIds":["han-shu_ch-59_p-196_s-1","han-shu_ch-59_p-196_s-2"],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"經文底本","edition":"中華經典古籍精校本《漢書》","url":"https://github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-197","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","order":197,"canonicalText":"〔一一〕師古曰：「偪，古逼字。」","sentenceIds":["han-shu_ch-59_p-197_s-1","han-shu_ch-59_p-197_s-2"],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"經文底本","edition":"中華經典古籍精校本《漢書》","url":"https://github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-198","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","order":198,"canonicalText":"天下之勢方倒縣。凡天子者，天下之首，何也？上也。蠻夷者，天下之足，何也？下也。今匈奴嫚娒侵掠，至不敬也，〔一〕為天下患，至亡已也，〔二〕而漢歲致金絮采繒以奉之。夷狄徵令，是主上之操也；〔三〕天子共貢，是臣下之禮也。〔四〕足反居上，首顧居下，〔五〕倒縣如此，莫之能解，猶為國有人乎？〔六〕非亶倒縣而已，〔七〕又類辟，且病痱。〔八〕夫辟者一面病，痱者一方痛。今西邊北邊之郡，雖有長爵不輕得復，〔九〕五尺以上不輕得息，〔一０〕斥候望烽燧不得臥，〔一一〕將吏被介冑而睡，〔一二〕臣故曰一方病矣。醫能治之，而上不使，〔一三〕可為流涕者此也。","sentenceIds":["han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-1","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-2","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-3","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-4","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-5","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-6","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-7","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-8","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-9","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-10","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-11","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-12","han-shu_ch-59_p-198_s-13"],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"經文底本","edition":"中華經典古籍精校本《漢書》","url":"https://github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-199","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","order":199,"canonicalText":"〔一〕　師古曰：「娒，古侮字。」","sentenceIds":["han-shu_ch-59_p-199_s-1","han-shu_ch-59_p-199_s-2"],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"經文底本","edition":"中華經典古籍精校本《漢書》","url":"https://github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-200","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","order":200,"canonicalText":"〔二〕　師古曰：「亡已，言不可止也。」","sentenceIds":["han-shu_ch-59_p-200_s-1","han-shu_ch-59_p-200_s-2"],"sourceRefs":[{"label":"經文底本","edition":"中華經典古籍精校本《漢書》","url":"https://github.com/bgc2017/chtxt"}]},{"id":"han-shu_ch-59_p-201","chapterId":"han-shu_ch-59","orde